      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranchita%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Verruga Post Office opened on September 22, 1917, and moved to Warner Springs in 1926.",
