      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "An 11‑foot‑tall fiberglass Yeti statue, the Rancheti, was erected on Montezuma Valley Road in December 2007 and featured on Zippy in 2016.",
